[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2453437174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98796#issuecomment-2453437174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98796","id":2453437174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SPHr2","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-03T13:57:04Z","updated_at":"2024-11-03T13:57:04Z","body":"In general, I really like this but I wonder if there is a better colour for the dark theme. Right now the readability is reduced for errors since the value contrast has become lower, see my black and white version. Warnings pretty much perfectly retain readability\r\n<img width=\"1460\" alt=\"Screenshot_2024-11-03_at_14 52 05\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60f21d5f-9ecc-40f3-a11d-381fb1d3d07f\">\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2453437174/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2453440433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98796#issuecomment-2453440433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98796","id":2453440433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SPIex","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-03T14:06:43Z","updated_at":"2024-11-03T14:08:37Z","body":"> In general, I really like this but I wonder if there is a better colour for the dark theme.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, we don't have control over this if we want a color that looks good on both dark and light themes. Using 256-color or 24-bit colors for this kind of stuff can be a double-edged sword, as you can no longer have a different color between a dark and light theme. With the basic 16 ANSI colors, their exact colors are determined by the terminal theme. This means the theme author can choose colors that look good given the background color (or at least try to).\r\n\r\nMost of the time, the trace location isn't that important for users either[^1], so it's not necessarily a bad thing that it becomes less prominent. The source file path can still be <kbd>Ctrl + clicked</kbd> for developers who are running Godot from a source repository.\r\n\r\n[^1]: It only points to the engine's C++ code, not to the user's scripts.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2453440433/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2453693764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98796#issuecomment-2453693764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98796","id":2453693764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SQGVE","user":{"login":"JyveAFK","id":32004318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDA0MzE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32004318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK","html_url":"https://github.com/JyveAFK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JyveAFK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T01:47:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T01:47:28Z","body":"Can we have a few peeps colour blind check this?  As it seems (to my colourblind eyes) really make it hard to read, it's too faint against the dark backgro